  - nodeId: ot_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "\u015Aroda. Wie\u015Bci przychodz\u0105 jak zawsze: telefonem, mailem, przez znajomych znajomych."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch5_lent_marek
    branchNodeId: ot_marek_pays
    nextNodeId: ot_marek
  - nodeId: ot_marek_pays
    lines:
    - speakerId: marek
      language: 0
      text: "Kuba, oddaj\u0119 te pi\u0119\u0107dziesi\u0105t euro z dwa tysi\u0105ce \xF3smego. Z odsetkami w postaci przeprosin. Je\u017Cd\u017C\u0119 taks\xF3wk\u0105 po Dublinie. Na apartament za ma\u0142o, na \u017Cycie wystarczy. Bez \"notions\"."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch6_marek_paid_back
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 50
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ot_tunde
  - nodeId: ot_marek
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Marek je\u017Adzi taks\xF3wk\u0105 po Dublinie i opowiada pasa\u017Cerom, \u017Ce by\u0142 kiedy\u015B deweloperem. Nikt mu nie wierzy, a on si\u0119 z tego \u015Bmieje."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ot_tunde
  - nodeId: ot_tunde
    lines: []
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch3_tunde_friend
    branchNodeId: ot_tunde_numbers
    nextNodeId: ot_bartek
  - nodeId: ot_tunde_numbers
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Tunde sko\u0144czy\u0142 ksi\u0119gowo\u015B\u0107. Pracuje w firmie, kt\xF3ra liczy dla rz\u0105du, ile Irlandia jest winna. M\xF3wi, \u017Ce to jak zmywanie: nigdy si\u0119 nie ko\u0144czy, ale kto\u015B musi to robi\u0107."
    - speakerId: tunde
      language: 1
      text: Same plates, Kooba. Bigger numbers.
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ot_bartek
  - nodeId: ot_bartek
    lines: []
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch5_kept_bartek
    branchNodeId: ot_bartek_cooks
    nextNodeId: ot_end
  - nodeId: ot_bartek_cooks
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Bartek gotuje na zmianie, kt\xF3r\u0105 kiedy\u015B prowadzi\u0142 Kuba. Ma w\u0142asne niebieskie plastry i w\u0142asnego nowego ch\u0142opaka przy zlewie."
    - speakerId: bartek
      language: 0
      text: "Panie Kuba... to znaczy, Kuba. Dzi\u0119kuj\u0119. Za tamten czwartek."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ot_end
  - nodeId: ot_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Ka\u017Cdy z nas wyl\u0105dowa\u0142 gdzie indziej. Ale wszyscy zaczynali\u015Bmy przy tym samym zlewie, z tym samym strachem i tymi samymi niebieskimi plastrami."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Zak\u0142adam grup\u0119 na Facebooku: \"Zlew u Declana, 2004\"."
      targetNodeId: ot_group
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Przepisuj\u0119 wszystkie numery do nowego telefonu, \u017Ceby \u017Caden nie zgin\u0105\u0142."
      targetNodeId: ot_numbers
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: ot_group
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Pierwszy do\u0142\u0105cza Marek. Drugi Tomek, z Wroc\u0142awia. Trzeci, po godzinie, Gavin, z komentarzem: \"Notions.\""
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch6_sink_group
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: ot_numbers
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Marek, Tomek, Agnieszka, Darius, Siobh\xE1n, Tunde, Declan. Siedem numer\xF3w. Siedem lat. Prawie."
